cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "tflplanner" in publications use:'
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: 'tflplanner: A ''shiny'' Study Manager for Clinical TFLs Made with ''rtfreporter'''
abstract: A shiny study manager for clinical tables, listings and figures made with
  rtfreporter. Each study is a folder of its own -- input data, definitions, programs,
  results and the records of its official runs -- defining the study analysis results
  data (ARD) and the reports built from it, with defaults and code lists drawn from
  a company standards workbook.
authors:
